      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "If $u=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$, then $2u=$",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying each component of $u$ by $2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2u & =2[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot 0 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1 \\\\ 2\\cdot (-2) \\\\ 2\\cdot 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
